  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CWR: Integration of non-institutional model of support to GBV victims into institutional frameworks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation Center of Women&apos;s Rights is implementing the 12-month project &quot;Integration of non-institutional model of support to GBV victims into institutional frameworks&quot;. This project is aimed at strengthening the non-institutional model of providing protection to victims of gender-based violence and women at risk provided by paralegals. This will achieved by attempting to establish a resilient and collaborative ecosystem for the protection of women who are victims of gender-based violence (GBV) through the effective and sustainable integration of key principles of non-institutional support model into institutional frameworks.</narrative>
  </description>
